# PUSH—Push Word, Doubleword, or Quadword Onto the Stack -- override
# The StackAddrSize = 64 branch of the manual's Operation (the only one in
# 64-bit mode), through the Push helper (lib.sdm) so the value is taken
# before RSP changes ("PUSH RSP pushes the value of RSP as it existed before
# the instruction was executed", Description).
@operation
Push(SRC);
